      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where do you deliver to?",
            "answer": "<p>The United Kingdom, from our UK warehouse. Delivery is free on two pairs or more. On a single pair there’s a charge, and you’ll see the full total before anything goes in your basket.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you deliver outside the UK?",
            "answer": "<p>This is still being confirmed, and we won’t promise a service we can’t yet support. If you’re outside the UK, email us and we’ll tell you honestly where things stand.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return them if I’ve worn them?",
            "answer": "<p>Returns are for unworn socks in the original packaging. You can try a pair on to check the size, the same as you would in a shop. If a pair is faulty that’s a different matter, and whether you’ve worn them makes no difference.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if my order doesn’t arrive?",
            "answer": "<p>Email or phone us with your order number and we’ll chase it with the carrier. Until the parcel reaches you, getting it there is our responsibility.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change or cancel an order?",
            "answer": "<p>If it hasn’t been dispatched, yes — email or phone straight away. After dispatch it becomes a return, and you have fourteen days from the day it arrives to tell us you’re cancelling.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you do exchanges?",
            "answer": "<p>If the size is wrong, the simplest route is to return the unworn pair and order the right one. Get in touch before sending anything back and we’ll tell you exactly what to do.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
