            "answer": "<p>We have not published a country of manufacture yet, and we are not going to print one we have not confirmed with the manufacturer. It is a fair question, it will be answered here plainly when we can evidence it, and in the meantime what we can say is that HydroSox is a UK registered company shipping from a UK warehouse.</p>"
